OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786128506
OL,3,CBlue Ribbon Healthcare's ratings
OL,4,Csuspended after ITV News exposes
OL,5,Calleged abuse
OL,7,FThe care regulator has suspended its
OL,8,Fquality ratings for two private care
OL,9,Fhomes after an ITV News investigation
OL,10,Fexposed allegations of abuse and
OL,11,Fneglect towards disabled residents.
OL,13,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC),
OL,14,Fwhich had previously rated the care
OL,15,Fhomes as 'Good', has confirmed it is
OL,16,Fnow investigating the Blue Ribbon
OL,17,FHealthcare Group after the prime
OL,18,Fminister ordered them to look into the
OL,19,Fcompany.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786128506
OL,3,CBlue Ribbon Healthcare's ratings
OL,4,Csuspended after ITV News exposes
OL,5,Calleged abuse
OL,7,FAndy Burnham said "there must be
OL,8,Fconsequences" after ITV News found
OL,9,Fresidents with learning disabilities
OL,10,Fwere living in "filthy" and
OL,11,F"dangerous" conditions, with a care
OL,12,Fworker found taking cocaine.
OL,14,FAt one residential home run by Blue
OL,15,FRibbon Healthcare Group, several staff
OL,16,Fmembers were suspended, and police
OL,17,Fwere called after they "bench-pressed"
OL,18,Fa resident with learning disabilities
OL,19,Fand threw them across the room.
OL,26,@oD@SOUpD@MO]rD@POUrD@WO]sD@AOUsD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
