OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786128506
OL,3,CBlue Ribbon Healthcare's ratings
OL,4,Csuspended after ITV News exposes
OL,5,Calleged abuse
OL,7,FAt another supported living service,
OL,8,Ftwo staff were investigated for
OL,9,Fsexually abusing a vulnerable resident
OL,10,Fafter they encouraged them to touch
OL,11,Ftheir breasts and buttocks.
OL,13,FMultiple whistleblowers who worked for
OL,14,Fthe company told ITV News residents
OL,15,Fare being seriously neglected.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
