OL,3,CBlue Ribbon Healthcare's ratings
OL,4,Csuspended after ITV News exposes
OL,5,Calleged abuse
OL,7,FThe CQC has suspended its quality
OL,8,Frating at Millbrook in Preston, a home
OL,9,Fwhere one resident with profound
OL,10,Flearning disabilities was found by his
OL,11,Fparents outside, naked, in the cold,
OL,12,Fstanding in a pool of his own urine
OL,13,Fand vomit.
OL,15,FOn a separate occasion, Rohan
OL,16,Fdeveloped frostbite on his feet after
OL,17,Fbeing left outside. His parents Liz
OL,18,Fand Ian told ITV News they feared for
OL,19,Fhis life at Blue Ribbon.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786128506
OL,3,CBlue Ribbon Healthcare's ratings
OL,4,Csuspended after ITV News exposes
OL,5,Calleged abuse
OL,7,FAfter an inspection by the CQC,
OL,8,FMillbrook was rated 'Good' in November
OL,9,F2025, at the same time Rohan was
OL,10,Fliving there. Rohan was eventually
OL,11,Fmoved out of Millbrook in March 2026.
OL,13,FThe CQC has also suspended its rating
OL,14,Ffor Willow Lodge, which it had also
OL,15,Frated 'Good' in 2023 after an
OL,16,Finspection.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
