OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786128506
OL,3,CBlue Ribbon Healthcare's ratings
OL,4,Csuspended after ITV News exposes
OL,5,Calleged abuse
OL,7,FIn an internal email seen by ITV News,
OL,8,FBlue Ribbon's Chief Executive
OL,9,FCharlotte Smith described conditions
OL,10,Finside Willow Lodge as "revolting" in
OL,11,FNovember 2025, warning her own
OL,12,Fmanagers that there was a "significant
OL,13,Frisk" of an inadequate rating by the
OL,14,FCQC and "significant enforcement
OL,15,Factions" if the regulator was to visit.
OL,26,@rD@XOUrD@bO]vD@IOUwD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
