OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786128506
OL,3,CBlue Ribbon Healthcare's ratings
OL,4,Csuspended after ITV News exposes
OL,5,Calleged abuse
OL,7,FITV News has asked the CQC for a
OL,8,Fresponse to its decision to rate
OL,9,FMillbrook 'Good' as early as November
OL,10,F2025, given the alleged treatment of
OL,11,FRohan. It declined to address that
OL,12,Fquery.
OL,14,FInstead, a spokesperson said: "These
OL,15,Fare truly shocking allegations of
OL,16,Fabuse, no person receiving care should
OL,17,Fever have to suffer such treatment or
OL,18,Fhave their dignity and independence
OL,19,Ftaken away from them.
OL,26,@vD@_OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786128506
OL,3,CBlue Ribbon Healthcare's ratings
OL,4,Csuspended after ITV News exposes
OL,5,Calleged abuse
OL,7,F"We continue to review information of
OL,8,Fconcern we hold about this provider to
OL,9,Fdetermine any regulatory action we
OL,10,Fneed to take and next steps.
OL,12,F"Our priority is to ensure people are
OL,13,Fkept safe, working with partner
OL,14,Forganisations such as local
OL,15,Fauthorities. We will publish any
OL,16,Faction we take when it appropriate to
OL,17,Fdo so."
OL,26,@oD@AOUyD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
