OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786128506
OL,3,CBlue Ribbon Healthcare's ratings
OL,4,Csuspended after ITV News exposes
OL,5,Calleged abuse
OL,7,FBlue Ribbon Healthcare Group, which
OL,8,Falso runs Forevermore Care and Cade
OL,9,FCare, is a private company which
OL,10,Fprovides residential care and
OL,11,Fsupported living for adults with
OL,12,Flearning disabilities, autism and
OL,13,Fother mental health conditions.
OL,15,FIt operates across the North of
OL,16,FEngland. Since 2020, it has received
OL,17,Fat least #31 million in publicly
OL,18,Ffunded care contracts, according to
OL,19,Fdata from Tussell.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31911
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786128506
OL,3,CBlue Ribbon Healthcare's ratings
OL,4,Csuspended after ITV News exposes
OL,5,Calleged abuse
OL,7,FITV News has learned that five local
OL,8,Fcouncils and two NHS trusts are
OL,9,Freviewing the allegations uncovered in
OL,10,Four investigation.
OL,12,FLancashire County Council, who have
OL,13,Fpaid Blue Ribbon at least #9 million
OL,14,Fsince 2020, said it is "not making any
OL,15,Fnew placements with Blue Ribbon
OL,16,FHealthcare while we carry out further
OL,17,Fchecks".
OL,26,@vD@XOUyD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31912
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786128506
OL,3,CBlue Ribbon Healthcare's ratings
OL,4,Csuspended after ITV News exposes
OL,5,Calleged abuse
OL,7,FIt said it has "visited everyone in
OL,8,FLancashire who receives support from
OL,9,FBlue Ribbon Healthcare and, at this
OL,10,Fstage, we have not found any immediate
OL,11,Fconcerns about their safety or
OL,12,Fwellbeing."
OL,14,FMeanwhile the London-based private
OL,15,Fequity firm which owns Blue Ribbon
OL,16,FHealthcare Group has deleted any
OL,17,Freference to ownership of the company
OL,18,Ffrom its website.
OL,26,@oD@POUtD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31913
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786128506
OL,3,CBlue Ribbon Healthcare's ratings
OL,4,Csuspended after ITV News exposes
OL,5,Calleged abuse
OL,7,FQueen's Park Equity acquired a
OL,8,Fmajority stake in Blue Ribbon in
OL,9,FFebruary 2022, in a deal which valued
OL,10,Fthe care company at approximately #17m.
OL,12,FPublicly available accounts show
OL,13,FQueen's Park Equity financed Blue
OL,14,FRibbon's services, directly investing
OL,15,Fmore than #6.5m in loan notes, and
OL,16,Fhelping to raise further capital.
OL,18,FThe day before ITV News published its
OL,19,Finvestigation, the Queen's Park Equity
OL,20,Fwebsite showed a page celebrating
OL,21,Ftheir buyout of Blue Ribbon.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31914
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786128506
OL,3,CBlue Ribbon Healthcare's ratings
OL,4,Csuspended after ITV News exposes
OL,5,Calleged abuse
OL,7,FOn the web page, Queen's Park Equity
OL,8,Fsaid they chose to invest in Blue
OL,9,FRibbon because of its "uncompromising
OL,10,Ffocus on quality" and "expertise in
OL,11,Flooking after service users with high
OL,12,Facuity autism and learning
OL,13,Fdifficulties".
OL,15,FLead Queen's Park Equity investor
OL,16,FAlison Price specifically praised Blue
OL,17,FRibbon CEO Charlotte Smith and her
OL,18,Fteam for their "impressive success to-
OL,19,Fdate".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31915
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786128506
OL,3,CBlue Ribbon Healthcare's ratings
OL,4,Csuspended after ITV News exposes
OL,5,Calleged abuse
OL,7,FFollowing the publication of ITV News'
OL,8,Finvestigation, the firm took down the
OL,9,Fweb page and all references to its
OL,10,Fownership of the care company for nine
OL,11,Fdays.
OL,13,FOther companies who assisted the
OL,14,Fpurchase in February 2022 also removed
OL,15,Ftheir web pages.
OL,17,FITV News approached Queen's Park
OL,18,FEquity to ask why this page had been
OL,19,Fremoved. Their page was then put back
OL,20,Fup, with edits.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31916
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786128506
OL,3,CBlue Ribbon Healthcare's ratings
OL,4,Csuspended after ITV News exposes
OL,5,Calleged abuse
OL,7,FThe other companies websites remain
OL,8,Fremoved.
OL,10,FQueen's Park Equity declined to
OL,11,Fcomment on the changes to the web
OL,12,Fpage, and on the allegations of abuse
OL,13,Fand neglect at Blue Ribbon.
OL,15,FAccording to the latest financial
OL,16,Fstatements available on Companies
OL,17,FHouse, Blue Ribbon Healthcare Limited
OL,18,Fmade #1.3m profit after tax last year.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
