OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786128506
OL,3,CBlue Ribbon Healthcare's ratings
OL,4,Csuspended after ITV News exposes
OL,5,Calleged abuse
OL,7,FIn a statement, Blue Ribbon CEO
OL,8,FCharlotte Smith said: "The safety,
OL,9,Fdignity and wellbeing of the people we
OL,10,Fsupport have always been, and will
OL,11,Falways remain, at the heart of
OL,12,Feverything we do. When concerns are
OL,13,Fraised about our services, we take
OL,14,Fthem extremely seriously.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31918
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786128506
OL,3,CBlue Ribbon Healthcare's ratings
OL,4,Csuspended after ITV News exposes
OL,5,Calleged abuse
OL,7,F"We are committed to listening,
OL,8,Flearning and continually improving,
OL,9,Fand we have robust safeguarding,
OL,10,Fgovernance and quality assurance
OL,11,Fprocesses in place to ensure that
OL,12,Fconcerns are thoroughly reviewed,
OL,13,Fappropriate action is taken and
OL,14,Flearning is embedded across our
OL,15,Forganisation".
OL,26,@wD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G18/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31919
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786128506
OL,3,CBlue Ribbon Healthcare's ratings
OL,4,Csuspended after ITV News exposes
OL,5,Calleged abuse
OL,7,F"We have carefully reviewed the wider
OL,8,Fconcerns raised with us. Many do not
OL,9,Freflect the information available to
OL,10,Fus or are presented without important
OL,11,Fclinical, regulatory or factual
OL,12,Fcontext.
OL,14,F"Other concerns relate to historic
OL,15,Fincidents that were thoroughly
OL,16,Finvestigated at the time, with
OL,17,Fsafeguarding procedures followed,
OL,18,Frelevant authorities and regulators
OL,19,Fnotified where appropriate, and any
OL,20,Fnecessary actions taken."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G19/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
