CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786128506
OL,3,CBlue Ribbon Healthcare's ratings
OL,4,Csuspended after ITV News exposes
OL,5,Calleged abuse
OL,7,F"We remain proud of the care provided
OL,8,Facross our services and of the
OL,9,Fdedication shown every day by our
OL,10,Fcolleagues in supporting people with
OL,11,Fcomplex needs to live safe, fulfilling
OL,12,Fand meaningful lives.
OL,14,F"We remain committed to working openly
OL,15,Fand transparently with the people we
OL,16,Fsupport, their families, stakeholders
OL,17,Fand regulators, and to continually
OL,18,Fstrengthening the quality of care and
OL,19,Fsupport we provide."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G20/20
